      { "key": "worst-case", "title": "Explain worst-case and average-case analysis", "description": "Says why worst-case bounds are the usual guarantee and how the average case differs.",
        "concept": "Worst-case and average-case analysis", "definition": "Worst-case analysis bounds the most work on any input of size n; average-case describes typical inputs.",
